--[[============================================================================
    StudioGUI Creator v1.2 — WYSIWYG GUI Editor for Roblox
    Modeled after the Roblox Studio workflow.

    FEATURES
    • Studio docked layout     — top bar toolbar; docked tab panels:
                                 Instances (left), Explorer (top-right) and
                                 Properties (bottom-right)
    • UI-only catalog          — ScreenGui family + Folder; parts, meshes and
                                 other non-UI classes are rejected
    • Add Instance dialog      — top-bar button; search the UI catalog
    • AI Assistant             — button at the bottom of the Instances dock;
                                 Google Gemini chat with a provider card
                                 (API key, "Copy API Key Link", "+/-" model
                                 dropdown, "Fetch Models", model picker) plus
                                 Settings and Clear Chat buttons
    • Saves                    — top-bar button; draggable file manager with
                                 Add File / Rename / Load / Overwrite /
                                 View Code / Delete
    • Explorer                 — live hierarchy tree
    • Properties               — type-aware editing incl. multiline values
    • Viewport manipulation    — click to select, drag to move, 8-handle resize
    • ScreenGui protection     — the last remaining ScreenGui can't be deleted
    • Luau Exporter            — serializes the whole project into a clean,
                                 standalone, re-runnable Luau script
    • Robust input handling    — inset calibration, touch support, pcall guards

    ENVIRONMENT
    Executor LocalScript (Delta, Synapse, Wave, Script-Ware, ...).
    Editor UI is parented to a protected container (gethui/CoreGui fallback).
    User instances live inside project ScreenGuis under PlayerGui.
    AI settings and save files persist via writefile/readfile when the
    executor supports them, and fall back to session memory otherwise.
============================================================================]]

